# Source of Trust licensing

This repository contains works under two separate licenses. The license of a
file follows its category below; the repository is not offered under a choice
of licenses.

## CC0 1.0 Universal — original content

Original definitions, specifications, and documentation are dedicated under
CC0 1.0 Universal. This includes:

- All original Markdown content, including `src/pages/**/*.md`, `docs/`,
  README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, and the issue templates.
- Original editorial content rendered from those files on the website.

The complete terms are in LICENSE-CC0.

## MIT — original website source code and configuration

Original website implementation and supporting configuration are licensed under
MIT. This includes:

- Astro layouts and pages (`src/**/*.astro`), CSS (`src/styles/`), and TypeScript
  (`src/**/*.ts`).
- JavaScript in `worker/` and `scripts/`.
- `astro.config.mjs`, `wrangler.jsonc`, `package.json`, `package-lock.json`,
  `.gitignore`, `.github/workflows/`, `public/_headers`, and `public/robots.txt`.

The complete terms and copyright notice are in LICENSE-MIT. When redistributing
website code under MIT, including generated implementation assets, retain the
MIT notice.
Rendered editorial content remains under CC0.

## Previously published works and third-party material

The original content and code published before this licensing clarification
were released under CC0. Those grants remain effective and are not withdrawn
by the MIT designation for website implementation here. Existing Git history
and version tags preserve that publication record.

Third-party dependencies and referenced works retain their own licenses.
Linking to or citing a work does not dedicate that work under CC0 or MIT.
